{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">《美食新聞報道》由張與辰帶領蔡景行出發，首站拜訪了一間由馬來西亞檳城娘惹大廚親自掌廚的私房菜館——「娘惹嫁到」，帶觀眾重溫最純粹的家鄉情懷。隨後第二節則由蔡景行接力，聯手「波波」黃婧靈（黃婧靈）前往尖沙咀，品嚐性價比極高的無敵海景鐵板燒！</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>第一站：</strong>上環<strong>正宗娘惹私房菜</strong></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">張與辰在節目中最為推薦的是招牌「娘惹豆醬雞」，皆因這是他媽媽的拿手好菜，充滿家常溫暖滋味。大廚先將洋蔥頭與蒜頭炒香，隨後加入濃香豆醬與椰青燉煮，令味道層次極為豐富。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">另一道「香料魚肉蒸蛋」則採用馬來西亞北部的傳統蒸製做法，魚肉鮮美無比，香氣濃郁卻完全不會搶去鮮魚本味。拍攝期間，張與辰更與蔡景行向大廚偷師學藝，親自嘗試舂爛黃薑葉、青檸葉及南薑等靈魂香料，親身體驗正宗娘惹菜的獨特魅力。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">娘惹嫁到</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">地址：上環皇后大道中270-276號中央大廈1樓I號舖</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"9e5aaa10-414f-4237-8989-29a6a02f9117.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026l5UPzaQTLE1788230814.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"9e5aaa10-414f-4237-8989-29a6a02f9117.png.webp\"/><br/> </div><br/></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"1d9cc051-e55a-4ed2-92fe-3a06edbeedf4.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026R1GyM3ZA2T1788230813.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"1d9cc051-e55a-4ed2-92fe-3a06edbeedf4.png.webp\"/><br/> </div><br/></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>第二站：尖沙咀高性價比海景鐵板燒</strong></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">第二節由蔡景行帶領波波黃婧靈接棒，造訪一間只需 $198 即可邊歎美食邊享受無敵海景的超值鐵板燒店，菜式水準同樣令人驚喜：</p><ul class=\"tiptap-bullet-list\"><li></li><li></li><li></li><li></li><li></li></ul><p style=\"text-align: left;\">日々鉄板燒き</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">地址：尖沙咀廣東道3-27號海港城海運大廈地下OTG57號舖</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"c20c1c46-5138-4a63-b926-9d3101a95046.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026RH6rr6Yzsh1788230815.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"c20c1c46-5138-4a63-b926-9d3101a95046.png.webp\"/><br/> </div><br/></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"8d96d852-1739-4dec-9e65-fa200b32fb1b.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026I6ANZSHFbX1788230815.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"8d96d852-1739-4dec-9e65-fa200b32fb1b.png.webp\"/><br/> </div><br/></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"a15f1c3f-b62c-4ce1-8e69-462d376f2313.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026LhqZwr9c801788230815.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"a15f1c3f-b62c-4ce1-8e69-462d376f2313.png.webp\"/><br/> </div><br/></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"73c4cd04-0894-49d8-bab1-1fa4c3cd75ff.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026A2ou5dmXao1788230815.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"73c4cd04-0894-49d8-bab1-1fa4c3cd75ff.png.webp\"/><br/> </div><br/></div></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-01T13:59:49.349670+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":478,"images":6,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}